output [(if i==1 /\ j==1 then (((("\n"++show(x))++"\n")++"\ntotal:")++show(total))++"\n" else "" endif++if j==1 then "\n" else " " endif)++show(x[i,j]) | i in rows, j in cols]++["\n"];
set of int: cols = 1..5;
set of int: rows = 1..5;
array [1..25] of int: X_INTRODUCED_0_;
array [rows,cols] of int: x = array2d(1..5,1..5,X_INTRODUCED_0_);
int: total = sum([x[i,j] | i in rows, j in cols]);
